### Variável do token (preenchida automaticamente pelo login abaixo)
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@upf.br",
    "password": "abc12345"
}

### Listar categorias (padrão + minhas)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Faculdade"
}

### Criar categoria com nome repetido (deve dar 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lazer"
}

### Atualizar categoria
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/categories/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Estudos"
}

### Tentar alterar categoria padrão (deve dar 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Comida"
}

### Apagar categoria
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/categories/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}